In our life solutions business, we specialize in helping clients achieve financial security by providing a suite of retirement products and acting as a solutions provider to institutions. Since 2004, we have purchased life insurance policies from consumers seeking liquidity and have actively managed those policies over time. With over $10 billion in face value of policies purchased, we have helped thousands of clients maximize the value of life insurance. In our institutional business, we help insurance carriers and re-insurance optimize their legacy liabilities and create innovative consumer-facing products by offering a broad toolkit of data-based solutions.\
\
In our asset management business, we aim to provide our clients with excess return at every point along the risk-reward spectrum, from uncorrelated assets to fixed-income replacement and free-cash flow based investment solutions. We have a suite of ETFs that identify the most profitable companies through a systematic, data-driven approach leveraging the core concept of Free Cash Flow Return On Invested Capital. We also offer Reg-D private placement funds offering longevity asset exposure with an 8%+ annual dividend target.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>California</li><li>Florida</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>51-250</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Alternative Investing</li><li>Exchange-Traded F