naging client wealth, coordinating every aspect of a client\'92s financial life\'97including investment management, estate planning, tax strategy, asset protection, risk management, retirement, business planning, and personal cash flow.\
\
Operating on a discretionary basis, Abundance manages investment portfolios aligned with each client\'92s objectives, making timely and informed decisions without requiring pre-approval for every transaction. In addition, the firm offers ancillary family office services such as estate administration, asset distribution, trust and loan oversight, and select private banking support.\
\
Abundance also provides clients with access to private investment opportunities that align with their goals and risk profile. For retirement plans, the firm serves both organizations and individuals in fiduciary or non-fiduciary roles. It can manage assets directly or provide advisory services at both the participant and plan levels.\
\
Abundance is a joint owner of Foundation Premium Income GP, LLC and Foundation Green Income Fund GP, LLC\'97general partners to two pooled investment vehicles: the Foundation Premium Income Fund, LP and Foundation Green Income Fund, LP. The Premium Income Fund employs a strategy of selling option contracts on fundamentally sound securities while hedging downside risks. The Green Income Fund focuses on companies that prioritize environmentally sustainable practices.\
\
With a client-centered philosophy and a commitment to long-term stewardship, Abundance empowers individuals and families to build, preserve, and transfer wealth across generations.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Pennsylvania</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>Registered Investment Advisor (RIA)</abbr></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>11-50</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>"All-in-One" Advisor Platform</li><li>Account Aggregation</li><li>Client Data Gathering</li><li>Client Meeting Support &amp; Schedule Ap