\
APWG embraces a simple approach to private wealth management. Starting with a deep understanding of your needs, whether you\'92re an individual, family, corporate executive or retiree, our team of trusted professionals creates a comprehensive, strategic plan that puts your interests first.\
\
At the end of the day, our goal is straightforward: To help you make informed decisions that maximize your financial potential and enable you to achieve success.\
\
\
Our Beginnings\
Established in 1992, Allen Private Wealth Group supports the goals, aspirations, and complex needs of four generations of families, offering investment solutions, as well as advanced financial planning, risk management, and insurance. With over 35 years of investment and business planning experience, APWG has an impeccable reputation as a leading national wealth management firm \'96 and one of the top practices in Designed Securities network of independent advisors across Canada.\
\
What you can expect from Us\
Our Fiduciary Responsibility\
At APWG, we hold ourselves to the highest fiduciary standard. This means we always put your interests above our own. In fact, we have a duty of loyalty and care and will always act in your best interest. This also means we perform a thorough and ongoing analysis of your situation to ensure that our advice to you is detailed and accurate.\
Pension Style Asset Management\
As Portfolio Managers, APWG selects from a much wider range of asset classes and investments than is typically available to most investors. Often called pension-style asset management, this involves reviewing and considering traditional asset classes. As an investor, you will enjoy truly diversified investment portfolios, with an asset mix expected to enhance returns and reduce volatility.\
