\
The investment landscape is evolving rapidly, with increasing demand for personalization and tax efficiency. High-net-worth clients expect more than just off-the-shelf solutions\'97they want investment strategies tailored to their financial goals and tax situations. Direct Indexing enables advisors to meet these needs by providing greater control over portfolio holdings, tax strategies, and cost management. Alphathena simplifies the adoption of Direct Indexing, removing the operational and technological barriers that have traditionally made it complex. The platform\'92s automation ensures that advisors can deliver these sophisticated strategies without adding administrative burden or requiring extensive in-house resources. By leveraging Alphathena, advisors can differentiate their practice, strengthen client relationships, and navigate today\'92s evolving investment landscape with confidence. Whether an advisor is new to Direct Indexing or looking to refine their approach, Alphathena provides the tools, insights, and automation needed to succeed.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Illinois</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Technology</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="sel