ify Reviews</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_participantCard_dataWrapper"><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Amplify Reviews is a compliance-first platform focused on helping financial advisors embrace online reviews on their own terms. The 2022 updated SEC Marketing Rule marked the beginning of the "reputation economy" for financial advisors, and Amplify Reviews gives advisor firms the approach, tools, and technology to make the most of this opportunity.  Advisor firms use the Amplify Reviews platform and best practice approach to capture compliant testimonials from their verified clients.  The testimonials are then published in the format of online ratings and reviews to maximize the impact and influence of this powerful social proof.  The immediate benefit is a boost in conversion rates for prospects from all channels, including referrals.  In the long run, this review content becomes a pillar of the SEO and AI Discovery strategy for all Amplify Reviews clients.  Throughout the entire process, the advisor firm maintains as much control as possible while remaining fully compliant with all regulations.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Georgia</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="s