\
Here's some additional information about how we partner with wealth management firms:\
\
1) Tax filing. We can power tax filing experiences for clients that range from DIY all the way to fully assisted ("do it for me") based on the complexity of clients' tax situation and their preferences. This can be done in a fully embedded model, so we are able to work with partners who have their own tax professionals on staff as well as partners who would prefer to leverage our team of tax professionals.\
\
2) Tax forecasting. We can provide year-round engagement tools to help clients forecast their tax liability/refund, make quarterly estimated payments, optimize their withholdings, understand the tax implications of specific financial decisions/trades, etc.\
