e_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Asempa Wealth Advisors is a high-touch, independent wealth management firm based in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, with clients across Louisiana and Texas. We currently serve approximately 60 high-net-worth families and manage $215 million in assets under management (AUM). As a fiduciary firm, we are deeply focused on delivering personalized financial planning and investment management, with a strong emphasis on multigenerational wealth strategy, tax efficiency, and legacy-building.\
Our clients include business owners preparing for a liquidity event, successful physicians and attorneys, and wealthy retirees seeking a long-term financial partner. At the core of our work is a deep commitment to understanding the full picture of our clients\'92 lives, allowing us to provide forward-thinking strategies that align with their goals, values, and long-term aspirations.\
We custody assets at Fidelity Institutional and leverage a modern tech stack to deliver a seamless client experience. This includes Orion for portfolio reporting and client portal, MoneyGuidePro for advanced financial planning, Redtail for CRM, Holistiplan for tax integration, and 55ip for model rebalancing. Our operational infrastructure allows us to remain lean while maintaining a boutique, high-service model.\
We believe the future of wealth management belongs to firms that combine technical excellence with high emotional intelligence\'97and we\'92ve built our practice around that philosophy. Our service model is intentionally selective, allowing us to maintain close relationships and offer truly proactive advice. We\'92re not chasing scale for its own sake; instead, we are focused on smart, strategic growth while preserving the client intimacy that sets us apart.\
We intend to grow to $300 million next year, with a goal of becoming a $1 billion+ firm. We are open to collaborative conversations with like-minded firms\'97or larger firms sharing ideas on advisor development, succession planning, or business model innovation.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Louisiana</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Advisory Firm</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>Registered Investment Advisor (RIA)</abbr></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Estate Planning</li><li>Financial Planning</li><li>Mergers and Acquisitions Advisory</li><li>Philanthropy and Charitable Giving Services</li><li>Practice Management Solutions</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="se