ow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Authority Voices builds customizable, personalized, high-quality and compliant content marketing systems for your website, email and social media in your voice that generate leads and referrals for your independent RIA. The FA Content System\'99 is the first personalized research-driven content engine that actually understands YOUR specific clients and speaks their language. Early results are encouraging with $1mm+ of AUM directly attributable to our content strategy in 1 month of alpha testing. We're currently in beta mode with a few selected RIA owners. \
\
Here's How We're Different:\
\
Instead of giving you another generic "10 Tips for Retirement Planning" script, we dig deep into YOUR target market:\
\
\'95 Tech employees stressed about RSU taxes - we research their exact pain points and create content that speaks directly to them.\
\'95 Med spa owners worried about business succession - we develop messaging that hits their specific concerns.\
\'95 Recent widows overwhelmed with how to manage inherited assets - we craft empathetic, relevant content that builds genuine trust.\
\
The Process is Simple:\
1. We research your niche - Our tailored "voice of customer" research engine analyzes your target audience's real problems, language, and concerns. \
2. You share your voice - Record quick voice notes answering our prompts (takes minutes, not hours)\
3. We create your niche-specific Content Library - Get 100+ pieces of audience-specific content in your voice in 5 formats: video scripts, LinkedIn posts, newsletter and blog articles, and more\
4. Compliance-ready - Every piece is filtered and ready for your compliance review\
\
Create content libraries for as many niches as you want!  Think of the FA Content System\'99 as a sniper with a precise target each time, while other content solutions are mass spraying everyone with generic and ineffective financial content that speaks to no one.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Oregon</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Financial Technology</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Advisor Lead Gen</li><li>Digital Marketing</li><li>Website, Automation &amp; Workflow Support</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">