\
About me. 20+ year wealth management veteran. CFP, CFA, Stanford MBA. Helped build one of the largest fee-only firms in the nation, past co-owner of that firm.\
\
Retired from active wealth management and decided to upload 30 videos on YouTube about what the average person needs to know about retirement. Just my way to "give back". Never expected anything to come of it. After 100 days, my daughter called me up all excited. "Dad, have you looked at your YouTube channel?!!!".\
\
I came to Future Proof to broaden my network of excellent financial advisers. I know 20 of the best firms in the country. I'd like to know closer to 50.\
\
If your firm is a fiduciary 100% of the time to your clients, has been in business 10+ years, has a squeaky clean ADV, strong client retention and manages $500M+ in AUM, I'd love to meet with you and learn what types of clients are the best match for you and your firm. (if you are close to that AUM number or have something "super unique" about your firm, sign up to meet with me anyways).\
\
I am not a good match for firms selling services to financial adviser firms. I am retired now outside of my YouTube channel.\
