\
At Bancreek Capital Advisors, we believe the best investment edge comes from data\'97lots of it\'97and knowing how to cut through the noise to find the signal. Bancreek was built to take the rigor of institutional analysis and make it accessible to more investors.\
\
We are a registered investment advisor and sub-advisor for 1940 Act funds, managing strategies in actively managed ETFs that blend disciplined, data-driven analysis with practical investment judgment.\
\
Our Edge \'96 Big Data, Real Insight\
We harness massive datasets to identify companies with structural advantages\'97firms that grow organically, excel at acquisitions, and can weather economic turbulence. Our proprietary research process focuses on turning this data into actionable insights, blending quantitative analysis with human judgment to minimize surprises and maximize transparency.\
\
Accessible, Interactive, and Active\
 - Actively Managed ETFs \'97 BCUS (U.S. large-cap equities) and BCIL (international equities) deliver our process in a simple, liquid, tax-efficient  format.\
 - Interactive Tools \'97 From our CPI Inflation Visualizer to sector deep dives, we share the same analytics we use in decision-making so investors can explore the story behind the numbers.\
\
Why Meet Us at Futureproof?\
Markets are more complex and global than ever. Passive index investing has its place, but it can\'92t adapt to valuation shifts, macro trends, or emerging risks in real time. Our approach is designed for:\
 - Capturing opportunities in U.S. and international equity valuation gaps.\
 - Interpreting economic data in real time, not just reading headlines.\
 - Delivering institutional-grade analytics in an ETF wrapper for any investor.\
\
At Futureproof, we\'92d love to connect and share how our data-driven, transparent approach can help advisors, family offices, and institutions create better outcomes for their clients.\
\
