\
Description: BYH helps motivated professionals 35-50 years old with household income of $500k-$1M (typically at least one spouse in the tech/biotech and healthcare with equity comp) by providing fee-only fiduciary advice, investment management, and financial planning in Boston MA and beyond. While we\'92re based in Massachusetts, we also meet and work with clients virtually across the United States. The BYH Wealth Management program combines financial planning and investment management strategies to give clients full control of their financial situation. We provide not just professional guidance and advice, but an ongoing, organized process and clear framework for making smarter money decisions they can actually feel good about making. The purpose of our financial planning work is to empower clients to make well-informed and mindful decisions because they understand the impact of their choices. This allows them to truly use money as a tool not just to build wealth over time, but also enjoy life along the way. When we guide our clients through our planning process, we develop financial strategies that outline the actions to take to achieve specific goals and grow assets that can support a desired lifestyle in the future \'97 while fully enjoying important experiences in the present.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Massachusetts</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><