ostic financial technology built to power the full life cycle of private markets for wealth managers. BridgePort builds each RIA/MFO firm its own unique, digital, white-labeled private markets platform, with funds and deals determined by that firm, not BridgePort. Every private fund or deal your team interacts with, both legacy and current, can be onboarded. \
\
BridgePort digitizes your investments and investors, enabling seamless digital transactions with the click of a button. Investor statements, transaction documents, tax documents and more are all housed in BridgePort for a simple repository that can be easily searched and exported. BridgePort provides robust investment reporting, plus agnostic integration with any of your preferred technology providers and reporting platforms. \
\
