eight: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Cap Six Overview: Driven by Data. Powered by Insight.\
\
Cap Six is a long-only U.S. equity SMA manager built to deliver alpha through concentrated, high-conviction portfolios. Our process combines proprietary technology with experienced oversight to translate data into performance, emphasizing disciplined execution, active tax management, and rigorous evaluation of investment research.\
\
We offer five institutional-quality strategies, Large Cap Growth, Market Income, Mid Cap, Enfra Income, and Texas, with low account minimums ($100K) and a platform designed to support a wide range of advisor needs. Our flexible engagement paths include turnkey SMAs, model delivery, and custom strategy development\'97helping advisors implement differentiated equity solutions that align with their clients\'92 goals.\
\
What Sets Cap Six Apart\
\
High-Conviction Idea Engine\
Our proprietary research platform continuously evaluates over 12,000 research sources to identify the highest conviction investment ideas with a repeatable ability to drive alpha. Portfolios are concentrated in these names, guided by a merit-based performance framework.\
\
Tech-Enabled Portfolio Engineering\
We apply custom-built algorithms to construct portfolios with evidence-based sector, risk-factor, and position sizing constraints. This approach is designed to generate alpha through stock selection while maintaining a benchmark-aware risk profile.\
\
Experienced Oversight &amp; Tax-Aware Execution\
Cap Six integrates human judgment with systematic discipline. Our Investment Committee ensures consistency, risk alignment, and thoughtful decision-making, while our platform actively manages for after-tax outcomes, including ongoing tax-loss harvesting.\
\
Cap Six is committed to helping advisors deliver better outcomes through flexible, research-driven strategies and a collaborative, high-touch partnership model.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Texas</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>10 or fewer</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Public Equities - U.S.</li><li>SMAs</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Public Equities - U.S.</li><li>SMAs</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_video_wrapper"></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_sh