</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Center Street Companies is a private investment platform specializing in real estate credit and lower middle market financing solutions.\
