ard_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Clarus Wealth Ltd. is proudly independent and chartered, delivering exceptional financial advice tailored for individuals, business owners, and families across the UK. Founded in 2012, Clarus blends City-level expertise with a personal, approachable style\'97making outstanding financial planning accessible and engaging.\
\
As Chartered Financial Planners, we uphold the highest standards of integrity, transparency, and professionalism. Our advisers are not tied to any providers, which means every recommendation is 100% focused on our clients\'92 interests. We believe that truly effective financial planning goes far beyond transactions or portfolio performance\'97it\'92s about building trust, understanding ambitions, and guiding clients to clarity and confidence at every stage.\
\
Our services cover holistic financial planning, investment advice, retirement strategies, tax planning, estate structuring, business exit planning, and more. We specialise in supporting successful individuals and business leaders through key life changes: growing a business, navigating complex family wealth, or preparing for a fulfilling retirement.\
\
Most importantly, we listen. Clarus clients value our straightforward communication, deep technical know-how, and a team that genuinely cares. Everything we do is built on strong, lasting relationships and clear, honest conversations.\
\
Our goal: To empower every client with clarity around their financial future and enrich lives beyond the balance sheet. \
\
