table_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>Customers Bancorp, Inc. (NYSE:CUBI) is one of the nation\'92s top-performing banking companies with over $22B in assets making it one of the 80 largest bank holding companies in the U.S. Customers Bank\'92s commercial and consumer clients benefit from a full suite of technology-enabled tailored product experiences delivered by best-in-class customer service distinguished by a Single Point of Contact approach. \
\
Our Financial Institutions Group (FIG) team includes experienced bankers and seasoned wealth management industry veterans who understand the specific needs of the industries we serve, including the RIA community. From global wealth advisory firms to independent RIAs, we\'92ve built a flexible, advisor-friendly banking experience that supports your business, your clients, and enhances your reputation. \
\
\
Customers Bank does not have a wealth advisory arm. FIG exists to complement wealth managers and advisors, not compete with them. We\'92re focused solely on helping you run and grow your advisory firm, and enhance the services you can offer your clients.\
\
For RIAs, we offer:\
\'95	Treasury management services to keep your operations running smoothly\
\'95	Operating and growth lending solutions to fund expansion, M&amp;A, and succession plans\
\'95	Deposit and lending solutions for your clients, including innovative offerings such as securities-backed lines of credit and a market savings sub-advisory program. \
