s into their practices in a secure, compliant way.\
\
Here are a few key reasons RIAs are choosing our platform:\
\
\'95	Direct digital asset access \'96 Eaglebrook is a leading investment platform offering direct Bitcoin and digital asset investments specifically for wealth managers.\
\'95	Attract clients and increase AUM \'96 Bring held-away crypto assets (e.g., from Coinbase) into your practice without triggering a taxable event. Assets are held in institutional cold-storage custody and fully integrated with Orion, Addepar, and Black Diamond.\
