12.8 11h6.467q-0.367-1.767-1.233-3.417t-2.033-2.917q-1.067 0.9-1.8 2.367t-1.4 3.967zM5.733 11h5.033q0.367-1.8 0.933-3.217t1.433-2.75q-2.5 0.633-4.367 2.133t-3.033 3.833z"></path></svg><span>FinHive Solutions</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_participantCard_dataWrapper"><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Description</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><span class="readMoreWrapper" style="height: auto; -webkit-line-clamp: 3;"><span><abbr>At FinHive, we specialize in helping financial services companies break through to the financial advisor market. We understand that reaching and building sustainable advisor relationships requires more than generic marketing\'97it demands deep industry expertise, precise targeting, and systematic processes built for the unique challenges of financial advisor distribution.\
\
Our team combines extensive experience in asset management, ETF distribution, and advisor relations with cutting-edge marketing technology to deliver measurable results. We've help new ETF issuers scale, guide fintech companies through their first advisor acquisitions, and enabled investment managers to build the marketing infrastructure they need to grow assets under management systematically.\
\
