\
We work with clients who are navigating significant change\'97whether planning for retirement, managing an inheritance, facing divorce, or preparing for the next generation. These moments require more than financial projections. They call for meaningful conversations, trusted relationships, and strategies that reflect each client\'92s unique story.\
\
From offices in Edina, Minnesota, and Westlake Village, California, Flourish serves clients nationwide through a high-touch, collaborative model. Our proprietary Flourish Experience\'99 is designed to create space for clarity and confidence. We begin by understanding each client\'92s goals, values, and money beliefs, then develop customized strategies that align wealth with purpose.\
\
Our clients often include women building financial independence, couples focused on long-term security, and families preparing for generational planning. What unites them is a desire for advice that goes beyond the numbers\'97advice that helps them make thoughtful decisions with intention and peace of mind.\
\
We offer a comprehensive range of services including investment management, retirement and estate planning, tax coordination, and financial education. Our team combines emotional intelligence with deep financial expertise to guide clients through both the personal and practical sides of wealth.\
