\
We use a three-part strategy:  Avoiding environmentally dangerous industries, working with companies to improve their environmental policies,  and providing financial support to the non-profit groups that started us.  A group of environmental and public health nonprofits created Green Century Funds 35 years ago to help people save for their future without compromising their values and we're a leader in the space.\
\
The Green Century Funds avoid the most environmentally irresponsible industries including coal, oil, gas, nuclear energy, tobacco and weapons. Green Century Funds also use environmental, social and governance criteria and holds green bonds in its fixed income portfolio. \
\
Our award-winning shareholder advocacy team takes on global corporations and convinces them to adopt policies that improve our lives and protect the environment. We have successfully persuaded companies to protect forests, reduce plastic packaging, source more renewable energy and more, winning 87 policies in the last five years.\
\
Every dollar Green Century earns managing its Funds supports our nonprofit owners who stand up to special interests on problems that affect the public\'92s health, safety and wellbeing, such as pesticides, plastics and clean water. This unique aspect makes Green Century truly a distinctive firm, even among other firms that offer sustainable investing strategies. \
\
Green Century offers three fossil fuel free mutual funds: \
The Green Century MSCI International Index Fund, The Green Century Equity Fund, and The Green Century Balanced Fund.\
\
Hope to sit down with you soon.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Massachusetts</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Investment Management</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Investor Type: Company</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal">-</div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Size: Employees</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><abbr>11-50</abbr></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Offering</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Fixed Income</li><li>Mutual Funds</li><li>Public Equities - International</li><li>Public Equities - U.S.</li><li>Socially Responsible Investments</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper isFullWidth"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Solutions &amp; Services: Interested in</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>Mutual Funds</li><li>Public Equities - International</li><li>Public Equities - U.S.</li><li>Socially Responsible Investments</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selecta