 attractive absolute returns for our clients. GTT Capital Management\'92s investment team has 35+ years combined of asset valuation, credit analysis, and risk-inv mgmt experience. Our goal is to deliver to clients Current Income and Total Returns consistent with Capital Preservation and Prudent Investment Management. The firm's focus has traditionally been in SECURITIZED PRODUCTS, but has investment capabilities across all of LIQUID CREDIT/FIXED INCOME. The firm's primary fund, GTT HARVEST FUND, materially outperformed the Barclays U.S. Agg Index by &gt;2400bps from 2021-2025 (YTD). The Fund yielded only 2mos of negative performance from inception thru 2021, underscoring the Manager\'92s emphasis on Capital Preservation. The Fund is targeting a loss-adjusted yield of 7-9% under various future rate and market scenarios. Generically speaking, our goal as Managers is through our OTC broker-dealer network, to get a High Yield level return (call it 7-9%) for investors, while only picking up AAA/AA Credits or taking high quality IG Credit Risk, all while maintaining a relatively low portfio rate duration vs the majority of the market.  This strategy/approach requires hard work, patience and discipline. But we've managed to hit our yield bogeys managing our signature Fund this way for the past several years.</abbr></span></span></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Country</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>United States of America</li></ul></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">US State</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_displayVal"><ul><li>California</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="selectable_card_dataRow"><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper"><label class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_label">Company Type</label><div class="selectable_card_dataWrapper_